  "name": "Scanpy",
  "summary": "Performs Scanpy single-cell RNA-seq QC, normalization, HVG selection, PCA/UMAP/t-SNE, clustering, exploratory marker ranking, pseudobulk preparation, visualization, and Seurat or SingleCellExperiment RDS conversion to h5ad. Applies to established exploratory scRNA-seq workflows with explicit count and expression provenance; complementary skills cover scvi-tools models and AnnData format details.",
